# GRASS-SETTLE: the first frame after a camera cut onto FIELD_Barn must not show a grass area of another tone with a
# straight edge (FOLIAGE-PROOF 10-28, 1_field_grass lower left). p14: not instance-buffer truncation (the block
# came without any "truncated" line). p15: the block is screen-space - each cut is shot in Lit, then cut again and
# shot in Albedo and Velocity, and once with anti-aliasing off, three times over, to name the pass it appears in.
Дано run Scene "Open Scene FIELD_Barn.desce"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Entity "Sun"
Дано --subject selection set SunElevation 40
Дано --subject selection set SunAzimuth 20
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,900,2500
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,-0.15,-1
Тогда-вид 1_first taken right after the camera cut: left of the path the grass has the same tone as on 2_fov70; no pale block with a straight edge
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 3000,1500,-2000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -1,-0.3,0.5
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,900,2500
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,-0.15,-1
Тогда-вид 1b_cut2 second cut, Lit: same tone left of the path, no block
Когда run View "View mode: Albedo"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 3000,1500,-2000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -1,-0.3,0.5
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,900,2500
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,-0.15,-1
Тогда-вид 1c_albedo cut in Albedo: grass albedo uniform left and right of the path
Когда run View "View mode: Velocity"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 3000,1500,-2000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -1,-0.3,0.5
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,900,2500
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,-0.15,-1
Тогда-вид 1d_velocity cut in Velocity: no screen block of its own
Когда run View "View mode: Lit"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 3000,1500,-2000
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -1,-0.3,0.5
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,900,2500
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,-0.15,-1
Тогда-вид 1e_cut3 third cut, Lit: same tone left of the path, no block
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.FOV 70
Тогда-вид 2_fov70 FOV 70: the grass is uniform
